 Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 132px\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.9173%;height: 132px\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full BPSC Auditor 2026 Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 79px\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.9173%;height: 79px\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 79px\">\n<td style=\"width: 51.197%;height: 79px\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 48.7203%;height: 79px\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"357\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 79px\">\n<td style=\"width: 99.9173%;height: 79px\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 51.197%\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download Pre Result</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 48.7203%\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download OMR Sheet</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"BPSC OMR Sheet\" href=\"https://bpsconline.bihar.gov.in/candidate/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OMR Sheet</a> | <a title=\"BPSC OMR SHEET\" href=\"https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/wp-content/uploads/BPSC_content/Notices/Important-Notice-092026-Auditor-OMR-Upload_BPSC-20260805-3am5u2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Notice</a></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 51.197%\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download Answer Key</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 48.7203%\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"BPSSC Answer Key\" href=\"https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/